{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "9c49d7b3189ad52bc95278b697bbe5d290760eaa676ffc24a4bf17c28e50e27c", "ja": "いよいよ握手会だね♪　茜ちゃんの愛されハンドを\n求めしファンのみんなを元気いっぱい励ましちゃうぞ！", "zh": "握手会终于要开始了♪小茜要尽情勉励\n来寻求小茜爱之手的粉丝们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6560f4c11c0afe42a44252fafb3665048a8fed13ae68b9969ba7c780b7e40585", "ja": "念のために言っておくけど……\n普段、俺に言っているようなことをファンに言うなよ？", "zh": "为了以防万一，我先说好了……\n平时对我说的话，你可别对粉丝说喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "c744e59ceb3f9a218a28067d4bd082bba87587de1ed2a8e44d390ec087504156", "ja": "普段{$P$}ちゃんに言ってること？\nモテないでしょとか、青春は灰色だったでしょとか？", "zh": "平时对小{$P$}说的话？\n像是不受欢迎，或是青春是灰色之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8667f5051d2b62398a231e9b16423623627b9ec7b2d25ef47200d73feed2183a", "ja": "それだ！\nいいか、絶対に言うなよ。絶対にだぞ。", "zh": "就是那些！\n听懂了吗？绝对别说喔，绝对喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "65c1a5d9dbf957e1b3548bf3e497b67964e860d1019bd9d6be49b1394926e032", "ja": "言うわけないじゃーん！　茜ちゃんは空気読める子！\n{$P$}ちゃんにしか言いませーん♪", "zh": "怎么可能会说嘛～！小茜可是会看场合说话的！\n那种话只会对小{$P$}说喔──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
